      "content": "interesting. i want to dig a bit deeper into the \"cultural background\" part for both. for Victoria, when you say \"aspirational urbanite,\" do you mean she's mostly from a certain ethnic or racial background? and for Marcus, what kind of specific cultural or ethnic demographics should we be targeting for the cleaning products to make sure the ads feel authentic to his community?",
